{"repositoryId":1185459082,"availability":"available","full":"sharmavaibhav31/arachnode","name":"arachnode","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":24,"forks":46,"created":"2026-03-18T15:52:31Z","updated":"2026-10-11T18:14:25Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://arachnode.vercel.app","topics":["adventurer","edulinkup","elusoc","gssoc","gssoc-26","veteran"],"demo":"https://arachnode.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T03:00:37.043Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T03:00:37.043Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T03:00:37.043Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-17T03:00:37.043Z","stars":24,"forks":46}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A self-hosted microservice application for tracking automated job discovery, contact enrichment, and cold email generation.","I built this because managing engineering applications at product-based startups manually was slow and unscalable. As a third-year student approaching placement season, I needed a way to find relevant roles across multiple scattered platforms, uncover who the actual hiring managers were, and draft personalized outreach emails without spending hours on repetitive clicking. This system automates the top of the job-hunt funnel so I can focus on interviewing."],"features":["Crawls tech-focused directories (Wellfound, YC Jobs, Remotive) using Scrapy.","Scrapes structured job platforms (Naukri, LinkedIn, Internshala) via Playwright browser automation.","Normalizes job events and aggregates them into a central PostgreSQL database.","Deduplicates identical job postings intelligently based on company and role.","Queries the GitHub API and uses OSINT techniques to find technical stakeholders and recruiters for specific companies."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sharmavaibhav31/arachnode/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"60a40b96c8bc3e663dbec24e1951cbed26d7c57874c96c796db506e0